---

<section class="section" id="contatti">
  <div class="sparkles" aria-hidden="true"><span class="sparkle">✦</span><span class="sparkle">✦</span><span class="sparkle">✦</span><span class="sparkle">✦</span><span class="sparkle">✦</span></div>
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section__label el-in">Parliamone</span>
    <h2 class="section__title" style="margin-bottom:44px">Prenota o <em>passa a salutarci</em></h2>
    <div class="contacts__grid">
      <div class="contacts__card el-in">
        <h3>
          <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5c0 8 7 15 15 15l2-4-5-2-2 2c-2.5-1.2-5.8-4.5-7-7l2-2-2-5z" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          Prenota
        </h3>
        <p>Il modo più veloce: un messaggio e il tavolo è tuo.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:12px"><a href={waUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Scrivici su WhatsApp →</a><br /><a href="tel:+390685350920">Chiama: 06 8535 0920</a></p>
